WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.830
Open Video Studio.

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:04.999
Turn on Match the reference pacing.

00:00:04.999 --> 00:00:10.522
Upload your presenter video, then upload one reference video.

00:00:10.522 --> 00:00:14.687
Name the project, add your script, and confirm

00:00:14.687 --> 00:00:18.399
you have the rights to edit your footage.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.789
After analysis, Lumen measures the reference

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:26.052
and builds a timeline from your footage.

00:00:26.052 --> 00:00:30.130
You do not place cuts, zooms, or graphics by hand.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.659
The reference is measured only.

00:00:32.659 --> 00:00:36.247
Its pictures do not enter the finished file.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:42.137
The cut follows the reference rhythm: shot length, zooms,

00:00:42.137 --> 00:00:47.119
color, captions, and charts from numbers in your script.

00:00:47.119 --> 00:00:50.322
A screen-like shot holds your frame.

00:00:50.322 --> 00:00:53.169
An illustration uses your words.

00:00:53.169 --> 00:00:58.240
If the reference asks for B-roll, one Commons clip may be

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:03.577
added, and only with a CC BY, CC0, or public-domain license.

00:01:03.577 --> 00:01:06.246
The credit stays on the asset.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.639
Watch the result.

00:01:08.639 --> 00:01:12.431
Choose Approve this cut when it is right.

00:01:12.431 --> 00:01:16.963
Choose Regenerate video to rebuild the whole cut.

00:01:16.963 --> 00:01:24.177
Choose a section, then Regenerate selected section, to rebuild only that part.

00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:27.784
The manual editor stays on the page, so

00:01:27.784 --> 00:01:31.206
you can still change a shot yourself.

00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:37.302
If a chart needs a number, put that number in your script.

00:01:37.302 --> 00:01:39.118
Nothing is invented.

00:01:39.118 --> 00:01:44.477
If no Commons clip matches your words under those licenses,

00:01:44.477 --> 00:01:48.747
the report says so and the video still renders.

00:01:48.747 --> 00:01:54.106
Face tracking and a complex room background are not copied.

00:01:54.106 --> 00:01:58.284
Download the file, reload, and download again:

00:01:58.284 --> 00:02:01.645
both files are the same finished cut.

